you probably didn't intend this but i just wanted to take the
oppurtunity to squash a rumor:

dragon scale mail does not polymorph you! at all! ever!!!

if you happen to polymorph (perhaps because of walking over a
polymorph trap) while wearing dragon scale mail then you will
become a dragon corresponding to the type of the armor that
you're wearing.  this prevents you from destroying that valuable
armor.

because i am intrinsically mean, vile and nasty i would like
this behavior to change!  there should be nothing special about
dragon scale mail in that regard (i.e. if you polymorph then you
may lose the armor, simple and consistent).  of course, this
would have to be balanced by the natural availability of dragon
scale mail, unlike the current situation ...

